abstract: >-
  A 5-stage pipelined RV32I RISC-V processor in Verilog with hazard detection,
  forwarding, CSR and trap support (ECALL, MRET, illegal instruction), a
  dynamic branch predictor, and a self-checking regression suite. Synthesized
  and timing-closed at 100 MHz for an Artix-7 (not flashed to a board).
